  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="DA">Strengthening Institutional Capacity for Effective Delivery of Midpoint Nigeria&#x2019;s 2024&#x2013;2029 Plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="DA">This intervention will strengthen Midpoint Nigeria&#x2019;s institutional capacity to implement its 2024&#x2013;2029 Strategic Plan. After a baseline assessment, a three-day retreat will formalize governance policies, financial procedures, MEAL and fundraising systems. Twelve staff, board members and volunteers will participate, with external facilitators from Tearfund and Taste Nigeria. Post-retreat mentoring and quarterly reviews ensure adoption and sustainability, enabling Midpoint Nigeria to deliver its strategy effectively.</narrative>
  </description>
